A step's clip holds its last frame, and plays again later.

A step's own clip looped for as long as the step lasted, so a long step played
the same gesture from the start over and over. With stepReplayMs set (the page
sets it), the clip plays once and holds its last frame, its closing pose, and
plays again after stepReplayMs if the same step still asks for it and nothing
else has played since. A frozen or sleeping card skips that replay. Without
stepReplayMs the clip loops as before.

